<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine peso ends weak as Central Bank buys dlr.</title>
<headline>Philippine peso ends weak as Central Bank buys dlr.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------- March 4 -------------------------</p>
<p>* Peso average at 26.324 from 26.323</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>The Philippine peso ended lower on Tuesday at 26.325 from 26.322, pulled down by the Central Bank's heavy purchases of dollars, traders said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank had to intervene after banks sold their dollars due to the lower-than-expected cut in its overnight rates.</p>
<p>&quot;It was not enough to cause speculation in the foreign exchange rate,&quot; a dealer said.</p>
</text>
